          "quote": "A SEBM system (Sailong S2, Xi'an Sailong Metal Materials Co.,Ltd., China) was used to fabricate tungsten samples with dimensions of 10 mm × 10 mm × 4 mm. A tungsten plate with the size of 100× 100 × 10 mm was used as the substrate during the SEBM process. The vacuum pressure was controlled to be < 10^-2 Pa. The layer thickness was 50 μm and the hatch distance were 50 mm. Scanning speed (v) and beam current (I) were the main beam parameters during SEBM process. The beam power can be calculated by P=I × U, U is the voltage which is fixed to 60KV.",
